ete an obstacle course to unlock admin so that you can build, listen to music, and more! \nYou can save commands and builds (see :cmdbox and F3X :btools for the options). F3X building tools are mobile-compatible and feature multi-selecting parts (use the bottom right-hand corner button on mobile). \n\n[Version v3.5.7]:\nView full changelog by running :updatelogs ingame\n\nTo save a build, select all the items you want to save in F3X (see multi-select for mobile above). Then, press the save button. As of 6/27/2024, decals and skybox have been re-enabled in public servers. \n\nSay \":cmds\" for a list of commands. \nSay \"!rules\" to view the game's rules.\n\nSend me a PM if you run into any bugs/suggestions (or join the server below and report them there). The server link below has been updated (as of April 02, 2025)","path":"/game/333164326-50m-admin-house","slug":"333164326-50m-admin-house","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0651bae059fad6eafa69df5bbb37b59071fe819be334898f3c8f2ceec33467b0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-35d888c2fe0dfb79d1a07ced17e72c9d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":51854359,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-10-10T07:50:17.068Z","creator":{"name":"Administration Nation","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1581113210,"name":"Area 47: Roleplay","desc":"SCP - Area 47: Roleplay Welcome to Armed SCP Containment Area 47, a Role-Playing game for all things SCP!\n\nThis game is based on the SCP genre, and is a facility containing the most dangerous SCPs. The SCP Foundation is a multi-government collaboration to protect humanity. Contained in the facility are SCP Creatures of horror, SCP Monsters that could destroy the world if they ever escape. \n\nIn this SCP Site Roleplay, you can play as all kinds of roles like Class - D, Scientist, Mobile Task Force, Security Department, and many more! Through playing these various roles, level up your keycard clearance in the Foundation, and assist in creating the most secure SCP Facility to exist.\n\nWant to learn more about the Foundation, and get some special in-game perks? Join our group! https://www.roblox.com/groups/2760782/SCPF\n\nGame Rules: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/3551820","path":"/game/1581113210-area-47-roleplay","slug":"1581113210-area-47-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/ca36b48dfb810bf90d452bbba832832b16da0a9476696828c904ba5d1801d9cb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-503bf5bf94fd92b8a5e1d440fb8cab45/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":66154128,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-03-21T22:57:51.064Z","creator":{"name":"Special Containment Procedures Foundation [SCPF]","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":1333478699,"name":"The Lanes 🎳 Bowling","desc":"Welcome to The Lanes! A bowling alley and video game arcade.\n\n💰 Use coins to unlock new ball designs, animations, and play arcade games!\nEarn coins by completing games of ten pin bowling.\n\nIf you like this game consider joining the community for future updates and perks.","path":"/game/1333478699-the-lanes-bowling","slug":"1333478699-the-lanes-bowling","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/b50f42758441523768179841fcd7844e8f9a4ed219d38e0f87e96126eabd0df1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bfb7783cf2cfaae41e1c280f5bd6b745/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":13438995,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-21T15:19:21.641Z","creator":{"name":"Last Level Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4878988249,"name":"[ANNIV+MUAY/WU] Mighty Omega","desc":"Based on a manga and our previous game!\n\nBasic Controls :\n\nDouble tap 'W' to RUN \nWhile running pressing 'R' will toggle between jog/sprinting\n'Q' to DASH\nHold F with your combat style tool to BLOCK\nF + LMB for perfect block on guard break move\nF + RMB for counter on any hit\nLMB for attacking\nRMB for GUARD BREAK\n\nDevelopers :\n- IncredibleAyum, Yolomura, \nstreetjess, MisterAokiji, dodorider, IncredibleJuIes\n\nContributors :\n- MoltenPrime, Tacomura\n\nPremium players have a +8% stat gain boost","path":"/game/4878988249-anniv-muay-wu-mighty-omega","slug":"4878988249-anniv-muay-wu-mighty-omega","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/d6ab265526e55195cc409f9a1a5a379dfe45dec124b4243419127dca36858958.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-87249609dae614261c1058785f217b72/150/150/UnapprovedImage/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":64596407,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-11-23T17:52:13.233Z","creator":{"name":"Kengun Omega","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6243611442,"name":"[NEW8⭐]Demon Slayer Tower Defense Simulator","desc":"","path":"/game/6243611442-new8-demon-slayer-tower-defense-simulator","slug":"6243611442-new8-demon-slayer-tower-defense-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/7b4a1109bc576dd370f5a8276c8cffe488a308351507ffe312811d1d31435c78.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1ccc82f4a087cc053937d1230d9b4b77/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4714308751,"name":"Defend The Train","desc":"","path":"/game/4714308751-defend-the-train","slug":"4714308751-defend-the-train","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/6b0e566e82b48b1228dd0efeb498e89daf8202d14b4f0178a73e6e78e4a6f7d0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7836e7effc231a842b63576f8807569f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6273865312,"name":"⛺️Supernatural Simulator","desc":"","path":"/game/6273865312-supern